ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi009: OPEN_SHELL with one ADVANCED_FACE on a PLANE (z=0, normal +Z); FACE_OUTER_BOUND references an EDGE_LOOP for a unit-square outer wire; FACE_BOUND references an EDGE_LOOP for a small inner square (hole); one VERTEX_POINT entity (#v_shared at (0.5,0.5,0)) IS referenced by both the outer wire's edge and the inner wire's edge; STEP requires per-wire distinct VERTEX_POINTs — sharing IS the defect; kernel must split shared vertex into per-wire copies or reject as malformed */
